id: jf-einj
title: Discover current Jellyfin contracts and correct agent API scope
description: "Add authoritative current stable and preview Jellyfin contract discovery, support moving target aliases in compatibility analysis, refresh official TOON and PM release tooling, and make read-only API research scope only read-only-safe tools."
type: Plan
status: in_progress
priority: 0
tags[12]: agents,api,compatibility,coverage,jellyfin-10.11.11,jellyfin-12,openapi,read-only,release,research,toon,typescript
created_at: "2026-08-06T17:49:39.419Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-07T05:54:15.402Z"
assignee: codex-jellyfin-api-20260807
claim_principal: codex-jellyfin-api-20260807
author: codex-jellyfin-api-20260806
estimated_minutes: 720
acceptance_criteria: "jf schema versions reports current official stable and preview releases with validated artifact identities and deterministic compatibility commands; schema compatibility accepts latest-stable and latest-preview aliases while preserving explicit prerelease opt-in and never forwarding Jellyfin credentials; read_only_scope excludes mutating tools from tool_scope_count and unmatched tool evidence; TOON, pm-cli, and pm-changelog use latest available compatible versions and all output schemas/formats validate; all nested help and docs are current; focused, full release, privacy, PM, packaged, and compiled live read-only gates pass; no package is published"
definition_of_ready: All 47 PM items and active annotations inspected; all-status duplicate scan and 47-node/126-edge graph audit clean; global pm-cli already current at 2026.8.6; local server and latest stable both 10.11.11; newest preview rc4 and TOON 4.1.1 verified from primary sources; defect reproduced with sanitized aggregate output.
goal: jf-mqpo
value: Keep agent automation aligned with moving Jellyfin and TOON contracts without stale hard-coded preview examples or misleading read-only coverage.
impact: Agents gain a deterministic current-version discovery surface and trustworthy capability counts before executing Jellyfin operations or upgrade checks.
outcome: "A self-updating API compatibility workflow with accurate read-only scoping, schema-valid structured output, and read-only live proof."
why_now: "Jellyfin 12.0-rc4 and TOON 4.1.1 were released after the prior tranche, while the CLI still names rc3 and reports mutating tools as unmatched inside read-only research."
parent: jf-gn5j
reviewer: GitHub Actions plus AI review bots
risk: high
confidence: high
sprint: jellyfin-10.11.11-to-12
release: next-manual-release
blocked_reason: "External GitHub gate after all review fixes: independent approval required and hosted required checks remain unstarted; no safe branch-protection bypass authorized."
unblock_note: Final CodeRabbit pass produced a valid strict-output-schema finding; resume to enforce undocumented-field rejection before returning to external protected-branch gates.
